## qcPseudoPotential


## qcSymmetry Non-symmorphic

Key architectural insight: itsReciprocalOps currently serves both the k-fold (BuildKBlocks) and the G-space density symmetrization — but these want different op sets. The fold wants linear ops + time-reversal (unchanged, already reaches 3); the density wants the genuine {W|τ} point group with the phase and no false TR-inversion. I'll separate them.
  
